  "id": "self-relevance",
  "term": "self-relevance",
  "definition": "Self-relevance is the degree to which another person is personally connected or meaningful to someone, such as being a friend, acquaintance, or stranger. In this study context, higher self-relevance was linked to more generous sharing toward that person.",
